WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:03.180
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:06.210
Speed Duel!

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:10.720
The duel of the century begins!

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:18.630
Okay!  Here I go, everyone!

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.270
My turn!

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:26.440
From my hand, I activate the Field 
Spell, Trickstar Light Stage!

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:32.210
I can add one Trickstar monster 
in my deck to my hand.

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:36.880
Since I added this card to my 
hand instead of drawing it...

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:40.320
...I can Special Summon Trickstar Lilybell!

00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:49.560
Watch me, Brother.

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:54.740
I promise to defeat Playmaker.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:12.750
I run Across the universe

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:15.920
At the speed of light

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:17.790
Begin Loading

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:21.520
Open the door of dreams

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:25.090
VRAINS spreads

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:28.200
Believe in myself

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:31.730
VRAINS continues

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:37.040
The circuit draws the future

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:41.110
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:42.710
Access!

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:45.410
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:47.020
I'm now With the Wind

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.320
Link with my soul

00:01:49.430 --> 00:01:52.090
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:53.820
Now Win the Race

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:56.660
Connected world

00:01:56.940 --> 00:02:00.160
No matter when

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:03.530
Nothing is impossible

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:07.670
Strive for hope

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:12.240
And ride the wind!

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:32.400
I summon Trickstar Candina from my hand!

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:42.570
Her effect lets me add one Trickstar 
card in my deck to my hand.

00:02:43.610 --> 00:02:46.000
I'm still not done!

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:49.530
I activate Trickstar Lycoris's 
effect from my hand!

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:53.540
She Special Summons herself, 
and Candina returns to my hand.

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:56.250
Come out, Trickstar Lycoris!

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:03.800
Next up is my spell card!

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:06.670
I activate Trickstar Vision!

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:12.240
I Special Summon Candina from my hand by 
negating her effects and halving her ATK!

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:15.980
Come back, Trickstar Candina!

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:24.330
Then we both draw one card.

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:31.790
My Trickstars will show what they can do!

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:33.490
Lycoris's effect!

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:36.490
When you add a card to your hand...

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:39.030
...you take 200 points of damage.

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:45.550
And then Light Stage's effect.

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:49.840
When a Trickstar deals you 
battle or effect damage...

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:52.110
...you take 200 points of damage.

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:59.580
She's whittling us away.

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:02.090
Like poking us with a needle.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:05.180
Everyone is all here!

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:08.590
I'm going all out from the start today!

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:10.330
Already?

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:15.070
Come out, the circuit of dreams and hope!

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:27.910
Arrowheads confirmed!

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:31.860
The summoning conditions 
are two Trickstar monsters.

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:36.600
I set Lilybell and Candina 
in the Link Markers!

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:41.280
Circuit combine!

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.240
Watch, Brother.

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:48.330
Why is she rebelling against me?

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:50.040
Link Summon!

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:55.640
Appear, Link 2 Trickstar Holly Angel!

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:07.850
Whoa!  Blue Angel already Link Summoned!

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:12.460
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:15.860
You're up!

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:20.240
And I'll show you why 
Trickstars are so charming!

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:22.610
My turn!  I draw!

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:27.220
Due to Lycoris's effect, every time 
you add a card to your hand...

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.630
...you take 200 damage!

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:36.320
And Light Stage's effect 
deals you 200 damage!

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:43.250
Trickstar Holly Angel's effect activates!

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:47.450
When a Trickstar's effect deals you damage...

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:51.360
...she gains ATK equal to that amount.

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:55.700
She acts cute, but she pokes and pokes.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:06:01.320
As she slowly shaves away my LP, 
she raises her own monster's ATK.

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:03.130
Her offense is efficient.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:06.530
I summon Draconnet from my hand!

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:11.720
Draconnet's effect activates!

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:16.760
I can Special Summon a Level 2 
or lower monster from my deck.

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:19.360
Come, Bitron!

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.190
Here I go!

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:26.800
Let's see what you got!

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:30.140
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:40.510
Arrowheads confirmed!

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:44.350
The summoning condition 
is one Normal Monster.

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:47.210
I set Bitron in the Link Marker!

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:51.740
Circuit combine!

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:57.500
Link Summon!  Appear, Link 1 Link Spider!

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:04.810
Link Spider's effect activates!

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:08.280
Once per turn, I can Special Summon one Level 4

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:12.280
or lower monster from my hand next to its link arrow.

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:15.250
I call out Bitron!

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.190
Arrowheads confirmed!

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:23.860
The summoning conditions 
are two Cyberse monsters!

00:07:23.860 --> 00:07:24.790
Again?

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:29.300
I set Draconnet and Bitron 
in the Link Markers!

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:36.920
Circuit combine!

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.150
Link Summon!

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:42.820
Appear, Link 2 Link Bumper!

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:52.450
Arrowheads confirmed again!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:55.920
The summoning conditions are 
two or more Effect Monsters!

00:07:56.090 --> 00:08:02.190
I set Link 1 Link Spider and Link 
2 Link Bumper in the Link Markers!

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:05.340
When a Link Monster is used as material...

00:08:05.340 --> 00:08:08.550
...its Link Markers count as materials!

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:14.970
Circuit combine!

00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:17.540
Link Summon!

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:21.260
Appear, Link 3 Decode Talker!

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:30.460
There it is!

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:36.930
Playmaker used consecutive Link Summons 
to bring his ace monster, Decode Talker!

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:40.500
Let's battle!

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:43.970
Decode Talker attacks Holly Angel!

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:50.200
I won't let you!

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:54.380
I activate the trap card, 
Trickstar Reincarnation!

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:57.020
All cards in your hand are banished!

00:08:57.020 --> 00:09:00.350
Then you draw the same amount from your deck!

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:01.320
What?

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:08.320
You know what's going to happen!

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:15.020
Due to Lycoris's effect, you take 200 damage 
for every card you add to your hand!

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:21.710
Light Stage's effect deals 
you 200 more damage!

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:29.190
She wants to take away our LP during battle?

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:30.920
That's not what she's aiming for.

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:35.850
Then Holly Angel's effect increases her ATK!

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:39.890
She has more ATK than Decode Talker!

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.630
That's what she was aiming for!

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:44.930
But Decode Talker doesn't stop attacking!

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:48.070
The Quick-Play Spell, Security Block!

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:51.620
Decode Talker isn't destroyed 
in battle this turn!

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:53.490
Damage also becomes 0!

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:58.380
Yeah!  You protected Decode Talker!

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.180
Too bad!

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:03.720
I activate the trap card, Trickstar Scatter!

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:09.280
When a Trickstar battles, 
one monster is destroyed.

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:15.960
So you didn't protect it.

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:19.030
Don't underestimate me.

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:28.970
What will you do next?

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:30.840
You haven't challenged me so far.

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:33.850
Entertain me more!

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:43.370
When you destroy my Cyberse Link Monster...

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:48.020
...I can Special Summon Salvagent Driver 
from my hand in defense position.

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:56.800
I end my turn.

00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:59.770
Holly Angel's effect now ends.

00:10:59.980 --> 00:11:02.240
Her ATK returns to normal.

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:05.680
Hey, she's putting the pressure on us.

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:07.710
Are you okay, Playmaker?

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:11.310
Forget that.  You've noticed too, right?

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:14.420
Hanoi's presence is getting stronger.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:17.020
My turn!  I draw!

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:18.680
Oh oh!

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:19.650
That's it.

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:24.910
That's Hanoi's card.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:26.460
Like I told you!

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:28.960
What was that?

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:37.810
I banish the trap card, Trickstar 
Reincarnation, from my graveyard to activate its effect!

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:42.570
I Special Summon one Trickstar 
from my graveyard!

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:43.550
Resurrect!

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:47.320
Trickstar Lilybell!

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:52.660
Now that you have that card, it's over.

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:55.660
You can no longer defy me.

00:11:56.260 --> 00:12:01.000
Lilybell's effect allow her 
to attack you directly!

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:07.460
Here I go!  Attack Playmaker directly!

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:15.150
Light Stage's effect deals you 200 damage.

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:20.750
I'm falling!

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:34.020
Playmaker avoids a close call!

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:34.870
Be quiet.

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:39.340
Since Lilybell dealt you battle damage...

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:45.010
...I can add one Trickstar in my 
graveyard to my hand and end my turn!

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:48.220
She didn't play Hanoi's card.

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.920
Is that her strategy?  Or is it...

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:52.980
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:56.220
Due to Lycoris's effect, you take 200 damage!

00:12:57.520 --> 00:13:00.110
There's that combo again!

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:04.930
Then Light Stage's effect deals 200 damage.

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:13.340
And due to Holly Angel's 
effect, her ATK increases!

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:15.580
I can win!

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:17.810
Brother, are you watching?

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:23.050
I, Blue Angel, will defeat Playmaker!

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:24.750
Aoi...

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:31.920
When you were young, our 
parents died in an accident.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:38.960
Since then, I worked hard so that 
you wouldn't suffer any hardships.

00:13:40.260 --> 00:13:45.340
And now, I'm SOL Technologies' 
Security Manager.

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:50.300
I did this all for you, Aoi.

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:51.910
So why?

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:54.380
Why can't you understand?

00:13:58.040 --> 00:13:59.020
Huh?

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:01.990
Something's wrong...

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:05.960
I feel like I'm losing myself...

00:14:06.550 --> 00:14:08.190
She's acting weird.

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:11.930
Hanoi did something to her card.

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:17.610
I summon Defect Compiler from my hand!

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:23.790
Then I activate Salvagent Driver's effect!

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:31.010
I discard one spell card to Special Summon 
a Cyberse monster from my graveyard!

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:34.360
I bring back Link Bumper!

00:14:37.100 --> 00:14:39.310
I'm Blue Angel.

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:40.890
Pull yourself together!

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:43.490
Hey...  I'm asking you just in case...

00:14:44.740 --> 00:14:48.080
It's fine that you revived a Link 
Monster from your graveyard.

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:50.470
But you have less than 1000 LP.

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:52.760
You know that, right?

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:55.710
I need less than 1000 LP to do what I want.

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:57.910
So you do know.

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:22.000
Now!

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:24.200
Seize the wind, Playmaker!

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:26.310
Storm Access!

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:40.720
Playmaker has used his Skill.

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:42.360
That's what he was planning!

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:46.940
Playmaker can't use his Skill 
unless he has 1000 or fewer LP.

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:50.460
He was shaving away his own LP?

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:03.410
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.820
Arrowheads confirmed!

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:17.820
The summoning conditions are 
two or more Cyberse monsters!

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:23.490
I set Link 2 Link Bumper and Salvagent 
Driver in the Link Markers!

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:30.300
Circuit combine!

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:33.300
Link Summon!

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:37.790
Appear, Link 3 Encode Talker!

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:50.490
This is all Playmaker's design?

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:54.040
I wasn't putting the pressure on him?

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:55.250
Let's battle!

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:59.560
Defect Compiler attacks Lilybell!

00:16:59.820 --> 00:17:03.540
I activate the Quick-Play 
Spell, Frontline Disturbance!

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:05.840
I see.

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:12.580
You're going to lower Holly Angel's ATK 
by Lycoris's 1200 DEF, down to 1000.

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:14.110
But I won't let you!

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:16.510
I won't lose!

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:19.840
I activate my Skill!  Trickstar Fraud!

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:20.850
What?

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:22.490
A Skill now?

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:27.360
I discard one Trickstar during your turn.

00:17:27.660 --> 00:17:31.130
You're forced to draw until you 
have three cards in your hand!

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.420
Playmaker!

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:36.560
You have zero cards, so draw three cards!

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.610
You have 800 LP.

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:43.270
First, Lycoris's effect deals you 600 damage!

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:47.250
Then Light Stage's effect 
deals you 200 damage!

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:52.910
I win!  I defeated Playmaker!

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:54.730
Are you sure?

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:57.420
Defect Compiler's effect!

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:00.340
Effect damage becomes 0.

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:03.490
And I put one Defect Counter on this card.

00:18:05.130 --> 00:18:07.230
Damage becomes 0?

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:12.170
It's not over!  I still have one final card!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.580
The remaining card is Hanoi's.

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:20.610
This is bad.

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:24.700
I...  I'm...

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:27.850
A Knight of Hanoi!

00:18:28.280 --> 00:18:29.330
Stop it!

00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:36.240
I send Dark Angel in my hand to the 
graveyard to activate her effect.

00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:40.030
What happened?

00:18:42.110 --> 00:18:43.150
Silence!

00:18:44.020 --> 00:18:45.880
I'm sorry.

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:49.590
What happened to you, Blue Angel?

00:18:53.300 --> 00:18:55.140
She played it.

00:18:55.140 --> 00:18:57.790
What did Hanoi do?

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:06.190
By tributing Lilybell, your monster's 
attack switches to another monster.

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:10.770
Now attack Holly Angel instead!

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:18.000
The monster that's now being attacked 
gains the tributed monster's ATK!

00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:22.680
Due to Frontline Disturbance's effect...

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:26.940
...one monster on my field 
gains a Disturbance Counter.

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:30.220
That's pointless.  Pointless!

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:32.920
Holly Angel has higher ATK!

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:36.890
You lose, Playmaker!

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:39.620
Encode Talker's effect activates!

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:43.030
The linked monster isn't destroyed in battle!

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:44.800
And I take no damage!

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:50.200
And until the end of this turn...

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:55.340
...Encode Talker gains ATK 
equal to Holly Angel's ATK!

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:01.020
This is bad!

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:03.840
Any more berserk and she'll 
take mental damage!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:04.750
I know!

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:07.260
Stop this duel!

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:09.190
Cut the circuits!  Hurry!

00:20:09.190 --> 00:20:10.320
Yes sir!

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:18.370
I activate Defect Compiler's effect!

00:20:18.370 --> 00:20:25.250
I remove one Defect Counter to increase 
my Cyberse monster's ATK by 800!

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.380
This is bad!  Hurry!

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:53.000
I know!

00:20:53.920 --> 00:20:54.770
C'mon!

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:57.420
I'll take full responsibility!  Hurry!

00:20:57.780 --> 00:21:00.240
No good!  There's a system error!

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:07.380
Then due to Frontline Disturbance's effect...

00:21:07.380 --> 00:21:11.140
...I remove all Disturbance 
Counters from Encode Talker...

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:15.850
...to lower Holly Angel's 
ATK equal to Lycoris's DEF.

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.770
I'll end this!

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:27.230
Encode Talker attacks Holly Angel!

00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:40.340
Final Encode!

00:22:23.340 --> 00:22:26.350
Dance!  Strike with your heels

00:22:26.610 --> 00:22:29.890
Scream!  You Gotta Go  Raise your voice

00:22:30.310 --> 00:22:33.490
Sing!  Unleash your existence

00:22:33.810 --> 00:22:37.530
Get Away!  Until you surpass your limits

00:22:39.450 --> 00:22:41.450
Try It over and over

00:22:43.190 --> 00:22:49.610
In this world that spreads forever

00:22:49.960 --> 00:22:56.550
The timeline flows forever

00:22:56.840 --> 00:22:59.110
Nothing is certain

00:22:59.240 --> 00:23:00.790
In these isolated times

00:23:01.070 --> 00:23:02.520
Set Yourself Free without hesitation

